    {
      "id": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/832712791479795712",
      "url": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/832712791479795712",
      "title": "My latest books cartoon for the Guardian ",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/8a541c48570919693c6b9034fb445b4e/41c44937f4397d32-69/s640x960/f9e687a8846f2c1dc7f7217f3d204e3cd766d4bf.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"887\" data-orig-width=\"1600\" alt=\"Title: Prompts for a cartoon about Artificial Intelligence and writing   Panel one: a simple cartoon image of two attractive writers in a cafe. AI is generating their content so they are freed from the drudgery of writing! They are both smiling, the cafe is stylish and the colours are warm and inviting.   Panel two: now we see the happy readers. They have so much content! In fact, they don't have time to read it, so they are using AI to summarise it! They love consuming content while being in a contemporary cafe smiling with their friends.   Panel three: now a cartoonist comes into the cafe. Thanks to AI, he can generate content in seconds from just a few prompts, so he is relaxed and happy. He makes a humorous observation about books. Everyone laughs. Oh, how they laugh!\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/8a541c48570919693c6b9034fb445b4e/41c44937f4397d32-69/s75x75_c1/6e439edf1d6fe4c7b0ffa48f8870a5b9c51ef4e2.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/8a541c48570919693c6b9034fb445b4e/41c44937f4397d32-69/s100x200/4d507ce524016d4a9c3777f8f1b4b6295f0ce472.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/8a541c48570919693c6b9034fb445b4e/41c44937f4397d32-69/s250x400/95be30f03c0b515fb5314fa35b5a0d752436b9c9.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/8a541c48570919693c6b9034fb445b4e/41c44937f4397d32-69/s400x600/c2350d3773d48b43f3fc5a7ef53b457f46d5312f.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/8a541c48570919693c6b9034fb445b4e/41c44937f4397d32-69/s500x750/12d9664b515a9ecfb965528c7549061e215c2eef.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/8a541c48570919693c6b9034fb445b4e/41c44937f4397d32-69/s540x810/99a5a1b1b51b34735e09bb8988a39e2dda950b15.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/8a541c48570919693c6b9034fb445b4e/41c44937f4397d32-69/s640x960/f9e687a8846f2c1dc7f7217f3d204e3cd766d4bf.jp