    {
      "id": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/831985972777517056",
      "url": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/831985972777517056",
      "title": "A Halloween cartoon for the Guardian ",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/e4b1e0fad865b31537be6f70c34ea2bb/4569dc21886b4877-28/s640x960/22ddc48c4ea1a434d0a4ea54110ea4df11fe6371.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"1159\" data-orig-width=\"2048\" alt=\"One: It is all hallows' eve. The undead walk the earth, revenging themselves upon the living. At dawn they will return to the cold of the grave But first they will stop by the library and pick up some books for the coming year below ground..  Two: A door has been left ajar.  A single brave librarian waits at the desk.  Late fees are waived.  The returned books will be exorcised by a priest.  The townspeople know nothing.  Three: By morning, all that remains is a pile of novels in a heap of ashes where one ghoul, having spent too long browsing, was incinerated by the rising sun. A librarian dusts off the books and returns them to the shelves \" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/e4b1e0fad865b31537be6f70c34ea2bb/4569dc21886b4877-28/s75x75_c1/056f87345f2fd9fd4bac51020eaf66eb851a04cf.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/e4b1e0fad865b31537be6f70c34ea2bb/4569dc21886b4877-28/s100x200/59c7e87e33ff09861403dd39eff1debea0e6fb06.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/e4b1e0fad865b31537be6f70c34ea2bb/4569dc21886b4877-28/s250x400/3861b90e5109f19390dbb51f977ee0ace66f531d.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/e4b1e0fad865b31537be6f70c34ea2bb/4569dc21886b4877-28/s400x600/c29b3c752ccef850fdbb5d11b6d97280b8f2c85b.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/e4b1e0fad865b31537be6f70c34ea2bb/4569dc21886b4877-28/s500x750/7c95fd8887bbc4e91111b32e668c03a0acb52fc4.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/e4b1e0fad865b31537be6f70c34ea2bb/4569dc21886b4877-28/s540x810/5ca6d2100136a2148845bb9e0464bb8abb658a99.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/e4b1e0fad865b31537be6f70c34ea2bb/4569dc21886b4877-28/s640x960/22ddc48c4ea1a434d0a4ea54110ea4df11fe6371.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/e4b1e0fad865b31537be6f70c34ea2bb/4569dc21886b4877-28/s1280x1920/8a29b6be4d2458961d59fa7aa6194844